* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-md5-sha1-deprecate (+2/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  2 pull requests submitted:
  - Remove RFC5246 updates, change Section 2 intro text such that the exten=
sion is always included. (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-md5-sha1-deprecate/pull/19=20
  - Drop RFC7525 Updates. (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-md5-sha1-deprecate/pull/18=20

* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+30/-19/=F0=9F=92=AC40)
  30 pull requests submitted:
  - Remove sentence that is redundant with the paragraph that follows (by p=
kelsey)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/511=20
  - Clarify ambiguous grammar (by pkelsey)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/510=20
