    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/505=20
  - Fix several typos (by pkelsey)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/504=20
  - Define EncodedClientHelloInner before outer extensions. (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/503=20
  - not sure if omitting CH in IANA registry for ech_outer_extensions is ri=
ght or not (by sftcd)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/502=20
  - Fix a bit of formatting and remove ref to resolved issue #384 (by sftcd)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/501=20
